---
source: tests/fmt.rs
expression: visible(&output)
---
% Leading comment with a blank line after it
@misc{first,
  title = {First}
}

  % An indented note that sits between entries, kept verbatim.

This is prose. It mentions user@example.com and @article without braces.
@article this looks like a broken entry and gets a warning
@comment this is a BibTeX-style comment without braces
@comment{A braced comment attached to the next entry}
@misc{second,
  title = {Second}
}

 % note on the same line as the closing brace
@misc{third,
  title = {Third}
}

% Trailing comment at the end of the file
@comment{jabref-meta: databaseType:bibtex;}
